{
  "sourceLanguage" : "en",
  "version" : "1.0",
  "strings" : {
    "Use your Mac’s LAN address or Tailscale hostname. 127.0.0.1 points to this iPhone." : {"localizations": {"ja": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Mac の LAN アドレスまたは Tailscale のホスト名を使用してください。127.0.0.1 はこの iPhone 自体を指します。"}}}},
    "Purchase awaiting approval. Pro unlocks when Apple confirms it; free features remain available." : {"localizations": {"ja": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "購入の承認待ちです。Apple が購入を確認すると Pro が有効になります。無料機能は引き続き利用できます。"}}}},
    "Enter an http:// or https:// server address without a username, password, query, or fragment." : {"localizations": {"ja": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "http:// または https:// で始まるサーバーアドレスを入力してください。ユーザー名、パスワード、クエリ、フラグメントは含めないでください。"}}}},
    "Terminal connection changed. Refresh the terminal and reopen input before sending. If this continues, update both apps." : {"localizations": {"ja": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "ターミナルの接続が変更されました。送信する前にターミナルを更新し、入力画面を開き直してください。問題が続く場合は両方のアプリをアップデートしてください。"}}}},
    "Protect screen previews" : {"localizations": {"ja": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "画面プレビューを保護"}}}},
    "Hide notification details" : {"localizations": {"ja": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "通知の詳細を隠す"}}}},
    "Privacy" : {"localizations": {"ja": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "プライバシー"}}}},
    "Screen preview hidden" : {"localizations": {"ja": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "画面プレビューは非表示です"}}}},
    "Command finished" : {"localizations": {"ja": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "コマンドが終了しました"}}}},
    "Open tmuxonwatch to view your terminal." : {"localizations": {"ja": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "tmuxonwatch を開いてターミナルを確認してください。"}}}},
    "%1$@:%2$lld %3$@ finished" : {"localizations": {"ja": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "%1$@:%2$lld %3$@ が終了しました"}}}},
    "Ready for input." : {"localizations": {"ja": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "入力できます。"}}}},
    "Screen protection hides the app when inactive, including app-switcher previews, and syncs to Apple Watch. New local completion alerts hide session names and output. Remote alerts are controlled at their source; this setting cannot redact remote notifications already sent to your phone." : {"localizations": {"ja": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "画面保護を有効にすると、非アクティブ時のアプリ画面やアプリスイッチャーのプレビューが非表示になり、Apple Watch にも同期されます。新しいローカルの完了通知ではセッション名と出力を隠します。リモート通知の内容は送信元で管理されるため、この設定で送信済みのリモート通知を編集することはできません。"}}}},
    "Server saved" : {"localizations": {"ja": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "サーバーを保存しました"}}}},
    "Continue" : {"localizations": {"ja": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "続ける"}}}},
    "Open the Watch app to check its connection. Remote notifications require separate setup in Settings." : {"localizations": {"ja": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Watch アプリを開いて接続を確認してください。リモート通知は設定で別途設定する必要があります。"}}}},
    "APNs accepted %1$lld; %2$lld failed. Device delivery is not confirmed." : {"localizations": {"ja": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "APNs が %1$lld 件を受け付け、%2$lld 件が失敗しました。端末への配信は確認できていません。"}}}},
    "No registered devices. Enable Remote Push and notification permission, then try again." : {"localizations": {"ja": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "登録済みの端末がありません。リモートプッシュと通知の許可を有効にして、もう一度お試しください。"}}}},
    "APNs accepted no notifications. Check the relay configuration and device registration." : {"localizations": {"ja": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "APNs に受け付けられた通知はありません。リレーの設定と端末の登録を確認してください。"}}}},
    "Relay accepted the request but did not confirm APNs acceptance. Check your device before testing again." : {"localizations": {"ja": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "リレーはリクエストを受け付けましたが、APNs の受付は確認できません。再テスト前に端末を確認してください。"}}}},
    "The result is unconfirmed. Check your device before testing again." : {"localizations": {"ja": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "結果は未確認です。再テスト前に端末を確認してください。"}}}},
    "Server reachable; authentication passed. Start a tmux session with tmux new -s work (install tmux if needed)." : {"localizations": {"ja": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "サーバーに接続でき、認証に成功しました。tmux new -s work でセッションを開始してください（必要なら tmux をインストールしてください）。"}}}},
    "Server reachable; authentication passed. Start a session on the server with tmux new -s work, then test again." : {"localizations": {"ja": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "サーバーに接続でき、認証に成功しました。サーバーで tmux new -s work を実行してセッションを開始し、再テストしてください。"}}}},
    "Server reachable; authentication passed; session found. First output could not be read. Check the session and test again." : {"localizations": {"ja": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "サーバー接続、認証、セッション確認に成功しました。最初の出力を読み取れませんでした。セッションを確認して再テストしてください。"}}}},
    "Server reachable; authentication passed; session found; first output received." : {"localizations": {"ja": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "サーバー接続、認証、セッション確認に成功し、最初の出力を受信しました。"}}}},
    "Connection details changed. Test again." : { "localizations" : { "ja" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "接続情報が変更されました。もう一度テストしてください。" } } } },
    "Could not save the token securely. Please try again." : { "localizations" : { "ja" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "トークンを安全に保存できませんでした。もう一度お試しください。" } } } },
    "Read & Find" : { "localizations" : { "ja" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "読む・検索" } } } },
    "Input" : { "localizations" : { "ja" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "入力" } } } },
    "YOUR WORKSPACE" : { "localizations" : { "ja" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "ワークスペース" } } } },
    "Choose a session" : { "localizations" : { "ja" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "セッションを選択" } } } },
    "Following tmux focus" : { "localizations" : { "ja" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "tmux のフォーカスに追従" } } } },
    "Pinned target" : { "localizations" : { "ja" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "固定した接続先" } } } },
    "Preview" : { "localizations" : { "ja" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "プレビュー" } } } },
    "Live" : { "localizations" : { "ja" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "ライブ" } } } },
    "Reconnecting" : { "localizations" : { "ja" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "再接続中" } } } },
    "Watch connected" : { "localizations" : { "ja" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "Watch 接続中" } } } },
    "Watch on standby" : { "localizations" : { "ja" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "Watch 待機中" } } } },
    "Last checked %@" : { "localizations" : { "ja" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "最終確認 %@" } } } },
    "Your terminal, within reach" : { "localizations" : { "ja" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "ターミナルを、いつも身近に" } } } },
    "Connect your Mac in Settings, or explore the demo. Your watch will follow along." : { "localizations" : { "ja" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "設定で Mac に接続するか、デモをお試しください。Watch にも出力が表示されます。" } } } },
    "Try the demo" : { "localizations" : { "ja" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "デモを試す" } } } },
    "Reading snapshot" : { "localizations" : { "ja" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "スナップショットを表示中" } } } },
    "%lld matching lines" : { "localizations" : { "ja" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "一致する行：%lld" } } } },
    "The live stream continues on your watch." : { "localizations" : { "ja" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "Watch のライブ更新は続きます。" } } } },
    "Find in output" : { "localizations" : { "ja" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "出力を検索" } } } },
    "Done" : { "localizations" : { "ja" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "完了" } } } },
    "Share snapshot" : { "localizations" : { "ja" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "スナップショットを共有" } } } },
    "No terminal connected" : { "localizations" : { "ja" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "ターミナル未接続" } } } },
    "Send text to this pane, then press Return when you’re ready to run it." : { "localizations" : { "ja" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "このペインにテキストを送り、実行する準備ができたら Return を押します。" } } } },
    "Input preview" : { "localizations" : { "ja" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "入力プレビュー" } } } },
    "Explore the composer. Connect a terminal and unlock Pro to send input." : { "localizations" : { "ja" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "入力画面をお試しください。送信するにはターミナルに接続し、Pro を購入してください。" } } } },
    "Compose" : { "localizations" : { "ja" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "入力" } } } },
    "Type a command or reply" : { "localizations" : { "ja" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "コマンドや返信を入力" } } } },
    "Sending…" : { "localizations" : { "ja" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "送信中…" } } } },
    "Send text" : { "localizations" : { "ja" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "テキストを送信" } } } },
    "Return" : { "localizations" : { "ja" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "Return" } } } },
    "Escape" : { "localizations" : { "ja" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "Escape" } } } },
    "Ctrl-C" : { "localizations" : { "ja" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "Ctrl-C" } } } },
    "Save as shortcut" : { "localizations" : { "ja" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "ショートカットとして保存" } } } },
    "Your shortcuts" : { "localizations" : { "ja" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "ショートカット" } } } },
    "Saved on this iPhone. Choosing a shortcut fills the composer; it never runs automatically." : { "localizations" : { "ja" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "この iPhone に保存されます。選ぶと入力欄に挿入されますが、自動では実行されません。" } } } },
    "Reply from either screen" : { "localizations" : { "ja" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "どちらの画面からも返信" } } } },
    "Keep an eye on your work for free. With Pro, send input from your wrist or iPhone and keep your frequently used commands close." : { "localizations" : { "ja" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "作業の見守りは無料です。Pro なら手首や iPhone から入力を送り、よく使うコマンドを保存できます。" } } } },
    "Terminal input" : { "localizations" : { "ja" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "ターミナル入力" } } } },
    "Text sent. Press Return to run." : { "localizations" : { "ja" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "送信しました。実行するには Return を押してください。" } } } },
    "Key sent." : { "localizations" : { "ja" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "キーを送信しました。" } } } },
    "Pin a session or window to keep it on your phone and watch." : { "localizations" : { "ja" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "セッションやウインドウを固定すると、iPhone と Watch で同じ接続先を表示できます。" } } } },
    "Attached" : { "localizations" : { "ja" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "接続中" } } } },
    "Running" : { "localizations" : { "ja" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "実行中" } } } },
    "Active window" : { "localizations" : { "ja" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "アクティブなウインドウ" } } } },
    "Window" : { "localizations" : { "ja" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "ウインドウ" } } } },
    "Sessions" : { "localizations" : { "ja" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "セッション" } } } },
    "Refresh pace" : { "localizations" : { "ja" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "更新間隔" } } } },
    "Updates quickly while output changes, then eases back when quiet. Raising your wrist requests fresh output." : { "localizations" : { "ja" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "出力が変化している間はすばやく更新し、落ち着くと間隔を広げます。手首を上げると最新の出力を要求します。" } } } },
    "Command finished alerts" : { "localizations" : { "ja" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "コマンド完了通知" } } } },
    "Reply from your Apple Watch or iPhone. Dictate, send keys, and save your frequently used commands on iPhone." : { "localizations" : { "ja" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "Apple Watch や iPhone から返信。音声入力やキー送信に加え、よく使うコマンドを iPhone に保存できます。" } } } },
    "Unlock Pro" : { "localizations" : { "ja" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "Pro を購入" } } } },
    "One purchase. Yours to keep. Live viewing, Read & Find, and sharing stay free." : { "localizations" : { "ja" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "一度の購入でずっと使えます。ライブ表示、検索、共有は引き続き無料です。" } } } },
    "Fresh output when you check in" : { "localizations" : { "ja" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "確認するときに新しい出力を" } } } },
    "Line breaks can run commands immediately. Send one line at a time." : { "localizations" : { "ja" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "改行を送ると、すぐにコマンドが実行されることがあります。1 行ずつ送信してください。" } } } },
    "Terminal" : {
      "comment" : "Tab title for the terminal view",
      "localizations" : {
        "ja" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "ターミナル" } }
      }
    },
    "Settings" : {
      "comment" : "Settings tab and screen title",
      "localizations" : {
        "ja" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "設定" } }
      }
    },
    "Back" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "ja" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "戻る" } }
      }
    },
    "Skip" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "ja" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "スキップ" } }
      }
    },
    "Next: Connect" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "ja" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "次へ：接続" } }
      }
    },
    "Try Demo" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "ja" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "デモを試す" } }
      }
    },
    "Install the Server" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "ja" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "サーバーをインストール" } }
      }
    },
    "Run this on the Mac where tmux is running:" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "ja" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "tmux を実行している Mac で次のコマンドを実行：" } }
      }
    },
    "The installer sets up Python, generates a secure token, and starts the server." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "ja" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "インストーラが Python をセットアップし、セキュアなトークンを生成してサーバーを起動します。" } }
      }
    },
    "Connect to Server" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "ja" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "サーバーに接続" } }
      }
    },
    "Scan the QR code from the install script, or enter details manually." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "ja" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "インストールスクリプトの QR コードを読み取るか、手動で入力してください。" } }
      }
    },
    "Scan QR Code" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "ja" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "QR コードを読み取る" } }
      }
    },
    "Camera Access Required" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "ja" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "カメラへのアクセスが必要です" } }
      }
    },
    "Open Settings" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "ja" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "設定を開く" } }
      }
    },
    "Cancel" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "ja" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "キャンセル" } }
      }
    },
    "tmuxonwatch needs camera access to scan the QR code. Enable it in Settings." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "ja" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "QR コードを読み取るには tmuxonwatch がカメラにアクセスする必要があります。設定から有効にしてください。" } }
      }
    },
    "SERVER URL" : {
      "comment" : "Section label for server URL field",
      "localizations" : {
        "ja" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "サーバー URL" } }
      }
    },
    "AUTH TOKEN" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "ja" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "認証トークン" } }
      }
    },
    "Paste token here" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "ja" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "トークンを貼り付け" } }
      }
    },
    "Token" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "ja" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "トークン" } }
      }
    },
    "Test Connection" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "ja" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "接続をテスト" } }
      }
    },
    "Testing..." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "ja" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "テスト中…" } }
      }
    },
    "Connected!" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "ja" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "接続できました！" } }
      }
    },
    "Retry" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "ja" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "再試行" } }
      }
    },
    "You're Connected!" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "ja" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "接続完了！" } }
      }
    },
    "tmuxonwatch will poll your tmux session and push live output to your Apple Watch." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "ja" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "tmuxonwatch が tmux セッションをポーリングし、ライブ出力を Apple Watch に届けます。" } }
      }
    },
    "Live terminal on your wrist" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "ja" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "手首にライブターミナル" } }
      }
    },
    "Notifications when commands finish" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "ja" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "コマンド完了時に通知" } }
      }
    },
    "Auto-refreshes in background" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "ja" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "バックグラウンドで自動更新" } }
      }
    },
    "Start Watching" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "ja" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "見はじめる" } }
      }
    },
    "Copy install command" : {
      "comment" : "Accessibility label",
      "localizations" : {
        "ja" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "インストールコマンドをコピー" } }
      }
    },
    "Server URL" : {
      "comment" : "Accessibility label for server URL field",
      "localizations" : {
        "ja" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "サーバー URL" } }
      }
    },
    "Authentication token" : {
      "comment" : "Accessibility label",
      "localizations" : {
        "ja" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "認証トークン" } }
      }
    },
    "Step %lld of 3" : {
      "comment" : "Onboarding progress accessibility label",
      "localizations" : {
        "ja" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "ステップ %lld / 3" } }
      }
    },
    "Connection error: %@" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "ja" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "接続エラー：%@" } }
      }
    },
    "QR code not recognized. Scan the code from the install script." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "ja" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "QR コードを認識できません。インストールスクリプトの QR コードを読み取ってください。" } }
      }
    },
    "QR code not recognized" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "ja" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "QR コードを認識できません" } }
